    "char_start": 4753,
    "end": 322.026,
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01",
    "start": 315.035,
    "text": "Outside of the RockShox suspension system, the failure mode is more difficult to detect.",
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 4908,
    "char_start": 4842,
    "end": 327.27,
    "sent_id": "t0035.s02",
    "start": 322.026,
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 4989,
    "char_start": 4909,
    "end": 331.452,
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01",
    "start": 327.27,
    "text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final part to land management.",
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5124,
    "char_start": 4990,
    "end": 341.398,
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01",
    "start": 331.452,
    "text": "That's where the conversation gets interesting, because the concessions regarding land management permeate everything we've discussed.",
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5158,
    "char_start": 5125,
    "end": 343.089,
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01",
    "start": 341.398,
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5233,
    "char_start": 5159,
    "end": 346.88,
    "sent_id": "t0038.s02",
    "start": 343.089,
    "text": "What is the opposing perspective that most listeners don't have access to?",
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5330,
    "char_start": 5234,
    "end": 352.979,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01",
    "start": 346.88,
    "text": "It boils down to this: drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5397,
    "char_start": 5331,
    "end": 357.172,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02",
    "start": 352.979,
    "text": "We've seen it happen with equipment that uses RockShox components.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5472,
    "char_start": 5398,
    "end": 361.874,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s03",
    "start": 357.172,
    "text": "If you ignore that, you'll end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5508,
    "char_start": 5473,
    "end": 363.737,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01",
    "start": 361.874,
    "text": "What does a failure mode look like?",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5570,
    "char_start": 5509,
    "end": 366.984,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02",
    "start": 363.737,
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5667,
    "char_start": 5571,
    "end": 373.285,
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01",
    "start": 366.984,
    "text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that new builders make is excavating with too much of a slope.",
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5748,
    "char_start": 5668,
    "end": 378.535,
    "sent_id": "t0041.s02",
    "start": 373.285,
    "text": "The framework is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5822,
    "char_start": 5749,
    "end": 382.675,
    "sent_id": "t0042.s01",
    "start": 378.535,
    "text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing that listeners can try out this week?",
    "unit_id": "t0042.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5891,
    "char_start": 5823,
    "end": 387.267,
    "sent_id": "t0043.s01",
    "start": 382.675,
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5921,
    "char_start": 5892,
    "end": 389.226,
    "sent_id": "t0043.s02",
    "start": 387.267,
    "text": "Everything else is iteration.",
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5977,
    "char_start": 5922,
    "end": 392.958,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s01",
    "start": 389.226,
    "text": "And finally, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6061,
    "char_start": 5978,
    "end": 398.589,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s02",
    "start": 392.958,
    "text": "Linear is the incident management tool built for speed – designed for the keyboard.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6089,
    "char_start": 6062,
    "end": 400.421,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s03",
    "start": 398.589,
    "text": "Check it out at linear.com.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6139,
    "char_start": 6090,
    "end": 403.235,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s04",
    "start": 400.421,
    "text": "Javier Benavides, thank you for the conversation.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6157,
    "char_start": 6140,
    "end": 404.879,
    "sent_id": "t0045.s01",
    "start": 403.235,
    "text": "Thank you, Lucía.",
    "unit_id": "t0045.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6207,
    "char_start": 6158,
    "end": 408.221,
    "sent_id": "t0046.s01",
    "start": 404.879,
    "text": "That's all for today's episode of Trail Sessions.",
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6226,
    "char_start": 6208,
    "end": 409.448,
    "sent_id": "t0046.s02",
    "start": 408.221,
    "text": "See you next time.",
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01"
  }
]
